         three are stock's values, carried with the rest of the scalar group, and
         they are inert — GnssPowerStatsProcessor multiplies them by a duration
         that is always zero. Kept for stock parity rather than removed, but
         recorded here so the absence is a stated fact and not an oversight: this
         block does NOT follow the same "declare the absence explicitly" rule the
         cellular note above does, because unlike a radio power model there is no
         way for these to attribute drain to hardware that is not there. -->
